<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3285018609590242066..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Child-Stealers and Prison Profiteers: A Case Study </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>10</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2477351902763120611</id><published>2014-03-08T00:31:45.375-07:00</published><updated>2014-03-08T00:31:45.375-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Another great article!  The state truly is evil - ...</title><content type='html'>Another great article!  The state truly is evil - how could anyone who reads this argue otherwise?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/2477351902763120611'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/2477351902763120611'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1394263905375#c2477351902763120611' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1062624314"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 8, 2014 at 12:31 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2802988880998270246</id><published>2014-03-02T18:21:20.104-07:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T18:21:20.104-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Fairy -- PLEASE contact me. We need to talk. </title><content type='html'>Fairy -- PLEASE contact me. We need to talk. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/2802988880998270246'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/2802988880998270246'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393809680104#c2802988880998270246' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bAwUsWSNJqY/Ut1X_S7xqyI/AAAAAAAAKBs/c-w-CbO5t1c/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 6:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7062241149588972890</id><published>2014-03-02T15:03:35.383-07:00</published><updated>2014-03-02T15:03:35.383-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This is Fairy Hitchcock of Hitchcock Family Advoca...</title><content type='html'>This is Fairy Hitchcock of Hitchcock Family Advocates...You forgot to mention that Timothy Gilligan, mentioned in this article, was allowed to make a video which is now used for training other new Staff for IDOC/IDJC and he is an honored presenter to &amp;amp; for the Idaho Prison Business.  The last time I attended an Idaho Criminal Justice Commission meeting the Agenda included his video...as I sat there, fully known for speaking out about this breach of ethics for years, they cancelled the Video and Presentation.  His &amp;quot;kind&amp;quot; prosecutor said they could not find his victim when the Judge asked why there was no victim present or a statement at Gilligan&amp;#39;s Sentencing.  I was there and spoke with the woman who was on Parole in Pocatello and had wanted to come to Boise but was refused permission and transportation costs or information on more than that he had admitted guilt and would be &amp;quot;taken care of&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/7062241149588972890'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/7062241149588972890'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393797815383#c7062241149588972890' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1523707840"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 2, 2014 at 3:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5595883706339165123</id><published>2014-03-01T07:18:55.278-07:00</published><updated>2014-03-01T07:18:55.278-07:00</updated><title type='text'>How high off the ground does a bar have to be to h...</title><content type='html'>How high off the ground does a bar have to be to hang yourself from it? Apparently, not as high as we thought. James Floyd Stewart has managed, while in detention, to hang himself from a bar 3 feet off the ground, using his trousers:&lt;br /&gt;http://www.codyenterprise.com/news/local/article_dbc472c6-9da3-11e3-96ce-0019bb2963f4.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/5595883706339165123'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/5595883706339165123'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393683535278#c5595883706339165123' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-698716348"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 1, 2014 at 7:18 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7641518514306781960</id><published>2014-02-28T16:50:44.758-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-28T16:50:44.758-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Thus saith the LORD; Cursed be the man that truste...</title><content type='html'>Thus saith the LORD; Cursed be the man that trusteth in man, and maketh flesh his arm, and whose heart departeth from the LORD. &lt;br /&gt;Jeremiah 17:9&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The great lie of our time: mankind is basically good. The Founding Fathers knew better, and framed the Constitution accordingly.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/7641518514306781960'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/7641518514306781960'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393631444758#c7641518514306781960' title=''/><author><name>Ruth of Exeter</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-673646382"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 28, 2014 at 4:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4986162183552540930</id><published>2014-02-27T07:34:34.690-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-27T07:34:34.690-07:00</updated><title type='text'>“We asked the judge for Donny to receive in-patien...</title><content type='html'>“We asked the judge for Donny to receive in-patient treatment. He agreed – and the bailiffs took him into custody immediately. That happened six years ago. He has been a prisoner ever since.”&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;six years??!!  your description of the juvenile system as a &amp;#39;gulag&amp;#39; is absolutely on target.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;my reading of these events indicates the system described is in the BUSINESS of creating future criminals - job security, if you will.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the other impression i got is that the system described is run by those infinitely worse than those who are incarcerated.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;it saddens me beyond description when i read of what those troubled youths must endure at the hands of &amp;#39;enforcement&amp;#39;, as it is obvious that those in that system will come out much worse than when they entered.  the specter of society paying crime incubators, hidden behind the moniker &amp;#39;juvenile detention&amp;#39;, to increase the criminal load among us goes to the heart of our authoritarian society. everything is a crime and everyone is a perp.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;there is a biblical warning about the treatment of children, millstones and the sea.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/4986162183552540930'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/4986162183552540930'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393511674690#c4986162183552540930' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-452750462"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 27, 2014 at 7:34 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1509557713739916922</id><published>2014-02-27T05:35:33.740-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-27T05:35:33.740-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I don&amp;#39;t think you&amp;#39;re too far off, Lamuel. ...</title><content type='html'>I don&amp;#39;t think you&amp;#39;re too far off, Lamuel. The &amp;quot;rabid dogs&amp;quot; have created jobs for themselves and their fellow travellers and will continue to perpetuate the gravy train until they are some how stopped. They know that they are otherwise unemployable and so does the state that sanctions this devilish corruption.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/1509557713739916922'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/1509557713739916922'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393504533740#c1509557713739916922' title=''/><author><name>William H.</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1091992025"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 27, 2014 at 5:35 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3028357845788248312</id><published>2014-02-27T03:19:23.968-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-27T03:19:23.968-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anybody have a realistic remedy, other than killin...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;Anybody have a realistic remedy, other than killing them, as one would a pack of rabid dogs?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s not the people attracted to unjustified power that we need to kill, but the obscene, corrupt institution that gives them that power.  Though, if the institution (government) will not yield to citizens demanding to be left alone to run their own lives, and to raise their own children without endless meddling, then all bets are off.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/3028357845788248312'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/3028357845788248312'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393496363968#c3028357845788248312' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-706487172"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 27, 2014 at 3:19 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6791886089749450018</id><published>2014-02-26T23:18:03.444-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-26T23:18:03.444-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I will quote the Bible even though I&amp;#39;m a pagan...</title><content type='html'>I will quote the Bible even though I&amp;#39;m a pagan. Matthew 18:6&lt;br /&gt;But whoever shall offend one of these little ones who believe in me, it were better for him that a millstone were hanged about his neck, and that he were drowned in the depth of the sea.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/6791886089749450018'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/6791886089749450018'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393481883444#c6791886089749450018' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1233283129"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2014 at 11:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2049679490289282839</id><published>2014-02-26T19:03:15.816-07:00</published><updated>2014-02-26T19:03:15.816-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This makes me sick to my stomach. Human evil seems...</title><content type='html'>This makes me sick to my stomach. Human evil seems to be boundless. Do we normal, sane, gentle people have to become killers, and wipe these vermin off the face of the earth, to ever put a stop to this kind of viciousness? How else will it ever end? Don&amp;#39;t quote Jesus to me. Turning the other cheek, and doing good to these hyenas, will not work. They have no conscience and no compassion. Do we have to become worse than them to make it stop? Or do we just have to mutely suffer for ever and ever and ever more at the hands of these scum? Anybody have a realistic remedy, other than killing them, as one would a pack of rabid dogs?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/2049679490289282839'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3285018609590242066/comments/default/2049679490289282839'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html?showComment=1393466595816#c2049679490289282839' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/02/child-stealers-and-prison-profiteers.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3285018609590242066' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3285018609590242066' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1438931946"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 26, 2014 at 7:03 PM"/></entry></feed>